@Nimble.Modulith.Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5002

### Register
POST {{Nimble.Modulith.Web_HostAddress}}/register
Content-Type: application/json
{"email":"user1@example.com","password":"user123"}

### Login
POST {{Nimble.Modulith.Web_HostAddress}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
{"email":"admin@nimble.local","password":"admin123"}

### List Products
GET {{Nimble.Modulith.Web_HostAddress}}/products

### Create Product (Admin)
POST {{Nimble.Modulith.Web_HostAddress}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
{"name":"Keyboard","description":"Mechanical keyboard","price":79.99}

### Create Customer
POST {{Nimble.Modulith.Web_HostAddress}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json
{"firstName":"Elisabeth","lastName":"Rothar","email":"user1@example.com","phoneNumber":"+380000000000","street":"Main 1","city":"Kyiv","state":"Kyiv","postalCode":"01001","country":"Ukraine"}

### Create Order (price comes from Products module)
POST {{Nimble.Modulith.Web_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
{"customerId":1,"orderDate":"2025-10-24","items":[{"productId":1,"quantity":2},{"productId":2,"quantity":1}]}

### Confirm Order -> OrderCreatedEvent -> Reporting + Email
POST {{Nimble.Modulith.Web_HostAddress}}/orders/1/confirm

### Reset Password
POST {{Nimble.Modulith.Web_HostAddress}}/users/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
{"email":"user1@example.com"}

### Orders Report JSON
GET {{Nimble.Modulith.Web_HostAddress}}/reports/orders?startDate=2025-01-01&endDate=2025-12-31

### Orders Report CSV
GET {{Nimble.Modulith.Web_HostAddress}}/reports/orders?startDate=2025-01-01&endDate=2025-12-31&format=csv

### Product Sales Report
GET {{Nimble.Modulith.Web_HostAddress}}/reports/product-sales?startDate=2025-01-01&endDate=2025-12-31

### Customer Orders Report
GET {{Nimble.Modulith.Web_HostAddress}}/reports/customers/1/orders
